  "Posted 15 July 2001, before Coruscant; the list has no Coruscant-set card, so the format is Premiere - Tatooine.",
  "Starting cards as posted under 'Starting 9': You Can Either Profit By This... / Or Be Destroyed, Tatooine: Jabba's Palace, Jabba's Palace: Audience Chamber, Han Solo, Podrace Prep, Tatooine: Podrace Arena, Anakin's Podracer, Boonta Eve Podrace and Strike Planning; these count toward the 60.",
  "Posted 'Jabba's Palace' dested the Light Special Edition site Tatooine: Jabba's Palace; 'Han Solo' the Premiere Han Solo (no version given); 'PP' Podrace Prep; 'T Mos Eisely' Tatooine: Mos Eisley.",
  "Posted 'Artoo' dested Artoo (Jabba's Palace) (Artoo, Brave Little Droid is a later Theed Palace card); 'Jar Jar' Jar Jar Binks; 'General Madine' General Crix Madine; 'Lando With Ax' Lando With Vibro-Ax; 'POAS' Projection Of A Skywalker; 'OOC/TT' Out Of Commission & Transmission Terminated; 'Weapon Levitation' the Light Jabba's Palace interrupt; 'Qui-Gon's Saber' Qui-Gon Jinn's Lightsaber (Qui-Gon's Lightsaber is a later Reflections III card); 'I Did It' I Did It!.",
  "The strategy opens: 'Sorry, take out POAS for HOTJedi' (probably Honor Of The Jedi); the list is kept as posted with Projection Of A Skywalker.",
